ith an axe looking up at a golden light in the stormy sky, a valkyrie silhouette above","valkyrie.einherjarCall":"two glowing golden norse warriors descending a rainbow bridge from the clouds, a valkyrie raising her spear below","valkyrie.asgardSpear":"an elegant silver spear with golden runes and white feathers tied below the blade, resting against a carved norse pillar","valkyrie.swanMaiden":"a swan maiden valkyrie with a cloak of white swan feathers diving from a misty lake shore, spear in hand","valkyrie.odinsLight":"a beam of golden light from a single great eye in the clouds striking a troll, healing glow on norse warriors nearby","valkyrie.jordheimGuard":"a stern shieldmaiden guarding the carved wooden gates of Jordheim with a tower shield glowing with a divine aura, snow","valkyrie.fallenWarrior":"a fallen norse warrior rising from the snow wrapped in golden light, a winged shadow passing over him","valkyrie.shieldSong":"valkyries singing and beating their spears on round shields in a line, glowing sound runes rising, northern lights","valkyrie.javelinVolley":"a rain of glowing golden javelins falling from a stormy sky onto a horde of trolls, norse mountains","valkyrie.runeMaiden":"a norse rune maiden painting a glowing rune of Odin on a warriors shield with her finger, firelit longhouse","valkyrie.hymnOfBraves":"a shield wall of norse warriors singing with raised weapons, golden light from Asgard shining down on them","valkyrie.valhallaLancer":"a valkyrie lancer diving from the clouds on white wings with her spear lowered, divine light trailing behind","valkyrie.aesirJudgement":"a giant golden spear of judgement striking down from the heavens onto a giant, norse gods silhouettes in clouds","valkyrie.einherjarVeteran":"a scarred einherjar veteran with a golden ghostly glow, braided grey beard, shield and axe, Valhalla hall behind","valkyrie.resurrection":"a valkyrie kneeling on a battlefield and touching two fallen warriors whose eyes open glowing gold, ravens circling","valkyrie.protectiveWings":"a valkyrie spreading huge luminous white wings over a line of norse warriors, arrows shattering on the light","valkyrie.valhallaHerald":"a herald of Valhalla blowing a long golden horn on a cliff, ghostly warriors answering from the clouds","valkyrie.odinsGaze":"the one-eyed god Odin seated on his high throne looking over Midgard, two ravens, cosmic sky, wise glowing eye","valkyrie.einherjarSpear":"a spear wrapped in golden light pulling a ghostly warrior soul from a battlefield, valkyrie hand gripping it","valkyrie.asgardMessenger":"a radiant valkyrie messenger landing with a golden horn of mead, healing light spreading to wounded warriors","valkyrie.valhallaJavelin":"a golden javelin piercing a wolf monster while a spirit of a warrior rises from the impact, snowy forest","valkyrie.asgardSentinel":"a towering armoured valkyrie sentinel guarding the walls of Asgard with a huge glowing shield, giants in the distance","valkyrie.revenantShieldmaiden":"a ghostly shieldmaiden revenant with a cracked shield and golden eyes standing among burial stones, mist","valkyrie.chooserOfSlain":"a dark valkyrie on a black horse pointing her spear at a doomed warrior on a battlefield, ravens and storm","valkyrie.valkyrieCaptain":"a valkyrie captain leading a flight of winged valkyries above a battle, golden aura shields over the warriors below","valkyrie.goldenSpear":"a magnificent golden spear forged by dwarves glowing with healing light over an anvil in a cavern forge","valkyrie.odinsWrath":"Odin furious in the storm clouds hurling lightning and golden fire onto a battlefield full of monsters","valkyrie.einherjarChampion":"a mighty einherjar champion in gilded mail with a great axe and a golden divine aura, Valhalla feast hall","valkyrie.valhallaFeast":"a grand feast in the golden hall of Valhalla with roasted boar, mead horns and laughing warriors, shields on the roof","valkyrie.valhallaGates":"the enormous golden gates of Valhalla opening with glowing warriors marching out, shield roof and spear rafters","valkyrie.hildr":"Hildr the valkyrie raising slain warriors at night on a moonlit battlefield, golden mist lifting the dead to their feet","valkyrie.skogul":"Skogul the valkyrie on horseback with spear and shield choosing a fallen king on a battlefield, storm clouds","valkyrie.gondul":"Gondul the valkyrie riding through the sky with a glowing shield, protective golden light falling on the army below","valkyrie.sigrdrifa":"Sigrdrifa the awakened valkyrie rising from a ring of shields and fire, glowing runes around her, a hero kneeling","valkyrie.sigrun":"Sigrun the valkyrie stepping out of a glowing burial mound at night, golden wings unfurling, reborn light","valkyrie.gungnir":"Gungnir, the spear of Odin, a legendary runed spear blazing with golden lightning floating above Asgard"}}},Vu={id:"champion",name:"Champion",nameEn:"Champion",realm:"hibernia",hp:30,startingRelic:"acorn",hook:"Lame et sortilèges de Valeur : affaiblis les serviteurs ennemis, puis fends-les à la grande épée.",heroPower:{id:"valorStrike",name:"Coup de Valeur",text:"Inflige 1 dégât à un ennemi. Un serviteur touché perd 2 Attaque.",cost:2,targeting:"enemy",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:1},{kind:"buffTarget",attack:-2}]},starterDeck:["champion.valorBlade","champion.valorBlade","champion.valorBlade","champion.debilitatingRune","champion.debilitatingRune","champion.debilitatingRune","champion.redBranchRecruit","champion.redBranchRecruit","champion.emainSquire","champion.emainSquire"],cards:[{id:"champion.valorBlade",name:"Lame de Valeur",type:"attack",rarity:"starter",cost:1,text:"Inflige 2 dégâts à un ennemi. Un serviteur touché perd 1 Attaque.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:2},{kind:"buffTarget",attack:-1}],targeting:"enemy",flavor:"L’épée s’illumine d’un sort de Valeur. Ce qu’elle touche tremble, puis faiblit."},{id:"champion.debilitatingRune",name:"Rune débilitante",type:"skill",rarity:"starter",cost:1,text:"Un serviteur ennemi perd 2 Attaque. Pioche 1 carte.",effects:[{kind:"buffTarget",attack:-2},{kind:"draw",amount:1}],targeting:"enemyMinion",flavor:"Un ogham gravé dans l’air, et le bras de l’ennemi pèse soudain comme du plomb."},{id:"champion.redBranchRecruit",name:"Recrue de la Branche rouge",type:"minion",rarity:"starter",cost:1,text:"Rage : +2 Attaque.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:2,health:3,enrage:{attack:2}},flavor:"À Emain Macha, on n’apprend pas à éviter les coups. On apprend à les rendre au double."},{id:"champion.emainSquire",name:"Écuyer d’Emain Macha",type:"minion",rarity:"starter",cost:2,text:"Cri de guerre : un serviteur ennemi perd 2 Attaque.",effects:[],targeting:"enemyMinion",minion:{attack:3,health:3,battlecry:[{kind:"buffTarget",attack:-2}]},flavor:"Il porte l’épée de son maître et connaît déjà trois sorts. Le premier sert à désarmer."},{id:"champion.hiberniaGreatsword",name:"Grande épée d’Ériu",type:"weapon",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Arme.",effects:[],targeting:"none",weapon:{attack:3,durability:3},flavor:"Aussi longue qu’un elfe et à peine plus lourde. Les Champions la manient d’une main, par fierté."},{id:"champion.frostEdge",name:"Tranchant de givre",type:"attack",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Inflige 3 dégâts à un serviteur et le Gèle.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:3},{kind:"freeze"}],targeting:"enemyMinion",flavor:"La lame se couvre de givre au milieu du coup. L’ennemi aussi."},{id:"champion.redBranchWarrior",name:"Guerrier de la Branche rouge",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:3,text:"Rage : +3 Attaque.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:4,health:5,enrage:{attack:3}},flavor:"Les héros d’Ulster suspendaient les têtes de leurs ennemis dans la maison de la Branche rouge."},{id:"champion.connachtSpearman",name:"Lancier de Connacht",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Ruée.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:3,health:3,keywords:["rush"]},flavor:"Les guerriers de Connacht chargent avant le signal. Le signal finit toujours par suivre."},{id:"champion.spiritBlade",name:"Lame spirituelle",type:"attack",rarity:"common",cost:3,text:"Inflige 3 dégâts. Ton héros gagne +2 Attaque ce tour.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:3},{kind:"heroAttack",amount:2}],targeting:"enemy",flavor:"Une lame de lumière jaillit de la vraie, frappe la première et laisse l’autre finir."},{id:"champion.connachtVeteran",name:"Vétéran de Connacht",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:4,text:"Provocation. Rage : +2 Attaque.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:4,health:7,keywords:["taunt"],enrage:{attack:2}},flavor:"Il a combattu pour la reine Medb pendant sept guerres. Chaque cicatrice le met en colère."},{id:"champion.ironWill",name:"Volonté de fer",type:"skill",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Gagne 4 d’armure. Ton héros gagne +2 Attaque ce tour.",effects:[{kind:"block",amount:4},{kind:"heroAttack",amount:2}],targeting:"self",flavor:"Un Champion ne recule pas. Il plante ses pieds, lève l’épée et attend qu’on vienne."},{id:"champion.silencingBlade",name:"Lame du silence",type:"attack",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Inflige 2 dégâts à un serviteur ennemi. Silence-le.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:2},{kind:"silence"}],targeting:"enemyMinion",flavor:"Elle tranche la chair et le sortilège d’un même geste. Le mage n’a pas fini sa phrase."},{id:"champion.lurikeenBlade",name:"Lame clurichaun",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Cri de guerre : inflige 1 dégât à un serviteur ennemi.",effects:[],targeting:"enemyMinion",minion:{attack:3,health:3,battlecry:[{kind:"damage",amount:1}]},flavor:"Petit, vif et susceptible. Un clurichaun ne pardonne jamais qu’on parle de sa taille."},{id:"champion.firbolgBrute",name:"Brute firbolg",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:5,text:"Rage : +3 Attaque.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:5,health:7,enrage:{attack:3}},flavor:"Le Firbolg dort au bord du lac. Le réveiller est une erreur ; le blesser, une catastrophe."},{id:"champion.weakeningHex",name:"Sort d’affaiblissement",type:"skill",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Gèle un serviteur ennemi. Il perd 2 Attaque. Pioche 1 carte.",effects:[{kind:"freeze"},{kind:"buffTarget",attack:-2},{kind:"draw",amount:1}],targeting:"enemyMinion",flavor:"Le premier sort que l’on enseigne aux Champions : ôter la force du bras qui frappe."},{id:"champion.whirlCut",name:"Moulinet",type:"attack",rarity:"common",cost:3,text:"Inflige 1 dégât à tous les serviteurs. Ton héros gagne +2 Attaque ce tour.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:1,target:"allMinions"},{kind:"heroAttack",amount:2}],targeting:"none",flavor:"La grande épée décrit un cercle complet. Amis et ennemis apprennent à se baisser."},{id:"champion.elvenSpellblade",name:"Lame-sort elfe",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:4,text:"Cri de guerre : Gèle un serviteur ennemi. Il perd 2 Attaque.",effects:[],targeting:"enemyMinion",minion:{attack:4,health:5,battlecry:[{kind:"freeze"},{kind:"buffTarget",attack:-2}]},flavor:"Elle chante en se battant. Chaque couplet glace un peu plus le sang de l’adversaire."},{id:"champion.runedGreatsword",name:"Grande épée runique",type:"weapon",rarity:"uncommon",cost:4,text:"Arme. Après une attaque de ton héros, Gèle la cible.",effects:[],targeting:"none",weapon:{attack:4,durability:3,onHit:[{kind:"freeze"}]},flavor:"Ses oghams brillent d’un bleu froid. La cible reste figée, le bras encore levé."},{id:"champion.oghamKeeper",name:"Gardien des oghams",type:"minion",rarity:"uncommon",cost:3,text:"Cri de guerre : Silence un serviteur ennemi.",effects:[],targeting:"enemyMinion",minion:{attack:3,health:4,battlecry:[{kind:"silence"}]},flavor:"Il connaît les vingt lettres d’Ogma. Une seule suffit à faire taire un sorcier."},{id:"champion.battleFrenzy",name:"Frénésie guerrière",type:"skill",rarity:"uncommon",cost:3,text:"Inflige 1 dégât à tous les serviteurs. Tes serviteurs gagnent +2 Attaque.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:1,target:"allMinions"},{kind:"buffMinions",attack:2}],targeting:"none",flavor:"Le cri du Champion fait saigner tout le 