ing a circle of standing rune stones in the rain, repainting faded runes","runemaster.thurisaz":"the thorn rune Thurisaz glowing red and striking twice like a giant thorn spike from the ground at enemies, mountains","runemaster.runist":"a stout dwarf runist with a braided beard hammering glowing runes into stone with a heavy hammer, forge sparks, dwarven hall","runemaster.ansuz":"the Ansuz rune of Odin glowing in the air above an old priest, whispering voices as blue wisps, ravens circling","runemaster.huscarl":"a huge norse huscarl warrior with glowing rune tattoos covering his bare arms, round shield and axe, snowy battlefield","runemaster.hagalaz":"the hail rune Hagalaz glowing in a dark sky above a battlefield as huge hailstones rain on an enemy army, Midgard","runemaster.novice":"a young norse woman novice carving a glowing rune onto the oar of a longship at a misty fjord shore","runemaster.stoneTroll":"a huge stone troll covered in carved glowing blue runes waking up and cracking free, moss and snow, Midgard mountain","runemaster.runeStaff":"an ornate ash wood runestaff carved with glowing blue runes and a crystal tip, resting against a snowy rock, aurora","runemaster.runicEcho":"two identical glowing blue runes echoing outward from a norse priest hands, rippling magical sound waves, dark temple","runemaster.niflheimBolt":"a bolt of freezing grey mist from Niflheim striking a warrior who turns to ice, ghostly cold fog, dark sky","runemaster.gothi":"a norse godi priest in a horned headdress reading runes in a bowl of blood at a sacrificial altar, wooden temple, fire","runemaster.raidho":"the Raidho travel rune glowing like a wheel flying through the air toward a target and returning, norse road","runemaster.jordheimCaster":"a norse rune caster on the walls of Jordheim throwing glowing rune stones like axes at enemies below, snowfall","runemaster.runicShield":"a circle of floating glowing blue runes around a norse priest, arrows shattering against it like glass, battlefield","runemaster.darkLance":"a long black lance of dark magic piercing through a raised shield, shadows and violet sparks, castle rampart at night","runemaster.runeBearer":"a norse woman carrying a leather pouch of glowing rune stones beside an old priest, handing him one, longhouse","runemaster.barrowWarden":"a towering undead norse king guardian in ancient armour standing on a burial mound of Vendo, glowing runes on graves","runemaster.runeStorm":"dozens of glowing blue rune stones flying out of an open pouch in a whirlwind striking enemies, snowy battlefield","runemaster.wellKeeper":"a norse priestess drawing a bucket of glowing runes from a spring at the roots of a giant ash tree, mist","runemaster.tiwaz":"the arrow-shaped Tiwaz rune of Tyr glowing on a sword blade as a norse warrior strikes a wounded foe, victory light","runemaster.runeElder":"an ancient norse rune elder asleep in a chair with glowing runes drifting from his fingers, apprentices collecting them","runemaster.messengerRaven":"a black raven with a glowing rune message tied to its leg flying fast over snowy norse mountains","runemaster.laguz":"the water rune Laguz glowing above a flowing spring stream washing away wounds from a norse warrior, healing blue light","runemaster.nineNights":"Odin hanging from the world tree Yggdrasil pierced by his spear, glowing runes falling beneath him, cosmic night sky","runemaster.jotunnCarver":"a frost giant jotunn carving huge glowing runes into a sea cliff with a stone chisel, longships sailing below","runemaster.fimbulvetr":"the great winter Fimbulvetr: a howling blizzard freezing an entire norse battlefield, warriors turned to ice, dark sky","runemaster.egill":"Egill Skallagrimsson, fierce viking skald poet with a huge head and dark beard carving runes on a drinking horn, longhouse","runemaster.vafthrudnir":"Vafthrudnir, the wise giant of norse myth, ancient and enormous, seated in his hall facing a hooded wanderer, runes glowing","runemaster.mimir":"