keen with big ears glowing like a firefly and crackling with light sparks, laughing, night meadow","eldritch.blindingFlash":"a blinding white flash of light exploding in front of a line of enemy soldiers covering their eyes, battlefield","eldritch.wellOfTirNaNog":"an elf drinking glowing blue water from a sacred well in the eternal city of Tir na nOg, crystal towers behind","eldritch.dunGuard":"a tall celtic elf guard with a long spear and green cloak standing on the royal hill fort of Dun Ailinne","eldritch.voidLance":"a lance of pure black void energy tearing a small hole in the world as it flies toward an enemy, violet sparks","eldritch.lightWarden":"an elf warden tending glowing crystal lanterns in the elven city of Tir na mBeo at night, each holding a spell","eldritch.radiantBlaze":"a wall of radiant white light sweeping across a battlefield, shadows and enemies pushed back, celtic hills","eldritch.connachtSage":"an old elf sage of Connacht carving ogham letters on a standing stone, glowing runes, misty green hills","eldritch.voidShield":"a shimmering veil of dark void energy around an elf mage, arrows vanishing into it, violet light","eldritch.starfall":"stars falling from a torn night sky onto an enemy army over the green hills of Hibernia, glowing meteors","eldritch.orbWeaver":"an elf mage weaving strands of light into glowing orbs like spinning wool, orbs floating around him, starry night","eldritch.voidRift":"a black crack of void opening beneath an enemy warrior and spreading to swallow others, violet energy, ruins","eldritch.manaSurge":"a surge of glowing blue mana rising like a tide from Lough Derg lake around an elf mage, moonlight","eldritch.lightMage":"an elegant elf woman light mage stepping into battle in a burst of golden radiance, enemies recoiling","eldritch.pathSentinel":"an elf sentinel with a tall shield guarding a meditating mage on a mossy stone path in an ancient forest","eldritch.mindFlare":"a glowing crystal spark of insight above an elf