i-lady: Skadi misses no beast on the snow.",flavorDe:"Öndurdís, die Schneeschuhgöttin: Skadi verfehlt kein Tier im Schnee.",art:"a bold thick pale ash-wood recurve hunting bow with frosted icy-blue tips, a white fur grip and a wolf-tooth charm, taut string, a few snowflakes",ref:"Öndurdís, « la dís aux skis », nom de Skaði, la chasseresse des montagnes (Skáldskaparmál)."},{classId:"thane",realm:"midgard",ilvl:78,stats:{power:6,armor:5,crit:4},name:"Marteau de Sindri",nameEn:"Sindri’s Hammer",de:"Sindris Hammer",flavor:"Sindri forgeait, Brokkr soufflait, la mouche de Loki piquait : ainsi naquit celui de Thor.",flavorEn:"Sindri forged, Brokkr blew the bellows, Loki the fly stung: so Thor’s own was born.",flavorDe:"Sindri schmiedete, Brokkr blies den Balg, Lokis Fliege stach: So entstand der Hammer Thors.",art:"a heavy dwarven forge hammer of dark iron with glowing orange forge runes and crackling blue lightning, a tiny bronze fly etched on its head",ref:"Sindri (Eitri), le nain qui forgea Mjöllnir pendant que Loki, changé en mouche, piquait Brokkr au soufflet (Skáldskaparmál)."},{classId:"healer",realm:"midgard",ilvl:77,stats:{spirit:7,stamina:5,armor:3},name:"Marteau de Lyfjaberg",nameEn:"Lyfjaberg Hammer",de:"Hammer von Lyfjaberg",flavor:"Sur la Montagne des Remèdes, Eir et ses sœurs soignent qui sait y monter.",flavorEn:"On the Mountain of Healing, Eir and her sisters mend all who can climb it.",flavorDe:"Auf dem Heilberg pflegen Eir und ihre Schwestern jeden, der ihn erklimmt.",art:"a silver norse war hammer with a white-blue healing glow, small green healing herbs bound to the haft and a snowy mountain peak engraved on its head",ref:"Lyfjaberg, la « montagne des remèdes » où siègent Eir et les vierges de Menglöð (Fjölsvinnsmál)."},{classId:"shaman",realm:"midgard",ilvl:77,stats:{spirit:6,power:5,stamina:4},name:"Bâton de la Gandreið",nameEn:"Gandreid Staff",de:"Stab der Gandreið",flavor:"Sur ce bâton, les esprits chevauchent le vent de nuit : c’est la gandreið.",